title: Packed code run at runtime
severity: medium
score: 25
tags: obfuscation
attack: T1027, T1059.007
description: The page ran large, high-entropy strings through eval/Function/setTimeout at
  runtime (packed code that only appears after decoding).
---
// Two or more strings run as code, the longest over 1 KB and the most random over 4.5
// bits per character: a packed payload unpacking itself.
code_exec
| where runs >= 2 and max_len > 1024 and max_entropy > 4.5
| project runs, max_len, max_entropy
